# Grammar for Spanish prepositional phrases (small demonstration for the report)
# Structural ambiguity: in "vi al hombre con el telescopio" the phrase "con el telescopio" can modify
# "hombre" (NounTail) or "vi" (VerbTail). The verifier shows it as a conflict at M[NounTail, PREP].
Sentence -> NounPhrase VerbPhrase
NounPhrase -> DET NOUN NounTail
NounTail -> PREP NounPhrase | ε
VerbPhrase -> VERB NounPhrase VerbTail
VerbTail -> PREP NounPhrase | ε
